publish	Build and publish both architectures	2026-10-21T12:20:36.1538919Z               "id": "5fb0901c28e36e6057ffcc5eadeb5b967e460596",
publish	Build and publish both architectures	2026-10-21T12:20:36.1540651Z               "message": "Add compatible team project creation\n\nSentry-compatible administrators could list team projects but could not create a project through the documented team route. Add strict ProjectIn admission and create the project, its first enabled key and the creator team membership in one transaction, preserving existing org/team authority, duplicate and foreign-team boundaries. Multi-team membership and per-project throttling remain explicit gaps.",
